BEHAVIOR clamp

DESCRIPTION
  Clamp x into [lo, hi]: returns lo if x < lo, hi if x > hi, else x.

CONTRACT
  INPUT x int 8
  INPUT lo int 8
  INPUT hi int 8
  OUTPUT result int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH 33bec962

IMPLEMENTATION
  xv = LOAD x 8
  lov = LOAD lo 8
  hiv = LOAD hi 8
  below = ILT xv lov 8
  BRANCH below use_lo check_hi

  LABEL use_lo
    STORE result lov 8
    JUMP end

  LABEL check_hi
    above = IGT xv hiv 8
    BRANCH above use_hi use_x

  LABEL use_hi
    STORE result hiv 8
    JUMP end

  LABEL use_x
    STORE result xv 8

  LABEL end
END
